[3.231139, "o", "Loading Whisper small.en ...\r\n"]
[6.427389, "o", "  heard New Recording 4.m4a in 1.7s: Loads of fly agaric under the birch is here. Must be a dozen red caps. Do you not let the dog near them?\r\n"]
[8.226625, "o", "  heard Recording_20261008_100211.m4a in 1.7s: Okay, starting from the car park. Ground is soaked from last night, the path by the first gate is basically a pond.\r\n"]
[9.919296, "o", "  heard Recording_20261008_101940.m4a in 1.6s: Two buzzards circling over the ridge. Maybe three, hard to tell, they keep dropping behind the trees.\r\n"]
[11.656347, "o", "  heard Recording_20261008_104105.m4a in 1.7s: Note to self the style after the second field has a broken step. Report it to the council rights of way team when I get home.\r\n"]
[13.092455, "o", "  heard Recording_20261008_111202.m4a in 1.4s: Heard a green woodpecker that laughing call, didn't see it though.\r\n"]
[13.234909, "o", "  heard Recording_20261008_112015.m4a in 0.1s: (no speech)\r\n"]
[14.810989, "o", "  heard Recording_20261008_113748.m4a in 1.5s: Blackberries still on the hedge by the lane, but most on mushy now. Come back with a tub in early September next year.\r\n"]
