[47.023512, "o", "## At a glance\r\n\r\n**Seen:** buzzard, fly agaric x12, blackberry\r\n\r\n**Heard (not seen):** green woodpecker\r\n\r\n**Path problems**\r\n- 10:02 ground: soaked from last night ([map](https://www.openstreetmap.org/?mlat=53.37335&mlon=-1.81576#map=17/53.37335/-1.81576))\r\n- 10:02 path: by the first gate is basically a pond ([map](https://www.openstreetmap.org/?mlat=53.37335&mlon=-1.81576#map=17/53.37335/-1.81576))\r\n\r\n**To do**\r\n- 10:41 stile: note to self the style after the second field has a broken step; report it to the council rights of way team when i get home ([map](https://www.openstreetmap.org/?mlat=53.37750&mlon=-1.78405#map=17/53.37750/-1.78405))\r\n- 11:37 tub: come back with a tub in early September next year ([map](https://www.openstreetmap.org/?mlat=53.36583&mlon=-1.81636#map=17/53.36583/-1.81636))\r\n\r\n"]
